# k.objects/shards/stand-ins-kinds: 13 common things with no drawing at all, drawn by the drawing of their kind (a stand-in: the host says "drawn as a ..."), the parent one step up in k.kinds that a world of the catalog states by name (k.attributes kind, k.animals, k.food, k.wearables). Written by tools/stand-ins-kinds.mjs.
# sources: hand-core 1 (the kind facts of the hand-written worlds, read through k.kinds.parent)
# license: CC0-1.0
# script: tools/stand-ins-kinds.mjs

# buzzard (a New World vulture that is common in South America and Central America and the southern United States): a kind of bird, by k.animals.animal
@k.objects.kinds.buzzard k.objects.stand_in name=buzzard drawing=bird core.source="hand-core 1"
# cape (a strip of land projecting into a body of water): a kind of coat, by k.wearables.wearable
@k.objects.kinds.cape k.objects.stand_in name=cape drawing=coat core.source="hand-core 1"
# cloak (anything that covers or conceals): a kind of coat, by k.wearables.wearable
@k.objects.kinds.cloak k.objects.stand_in name=cloak drawing=coat core.source="hand-core 1"
# condor (the largest flying birds in the western hemisphere): a kind of bird, by k.animals.animal
@k.objects.kinds.condor k.objects.stand_in name=condor drawing=bird core.source="hand-core 1"
# gingerbread (cake flavored with ginger): a kind of sweet, by k.food.food
@k.objects.kinds.gingerbread k.objects.stand_in name=gingerbread drawing=sweet core.source="hand-core 1"
# goulash (a rich meat stew highly seasoned with paprika): a kind of dish, by k.food.food
@k.objects.kinds.goulash k.objects.stand_in name=goulash drawing=dish core.source="hand-core 1"
# gravy (a sauce made by adding stock, flour, or other ingredients to the juice and fat that drips from cooking meats): a kind of sauce, by k.food.food
@k.objects.kinds.gravy k.objects.stand_in name=gravy drawing=sauce core.source="hand-core 1"
# guacamole (a dip made of mashed avocado mixed with chopped onions and other seasonings): a kind of sauce, by k.food.food
@k.objects.kinds.guacamole k.objects.stand_in name=guacamole drawing=sauce core.source="hand-core 1"
# hummus (a thick spread made from mashed chickpeas, tahini, lemon juice and garlic): a kind of dish, by k.food.food
@k.objects.kinds.hummus k.objects.stand_in name=hummus drawing=dish core.source="hand-core 1"
# mall (a public area set aside as a pedestrian walk): a kind of building, by k.attributes.thing
@k.objects.kinds.mall k.objects.stand_in name=mall drawing=building core.source="hand-core 1"
# paella (saffron-flavored dish made of rice with shellfish and chicken): a kind of dish, by k.food.food
@k.objects.kinds.paella k.objects.stand_in name=paella drawing=dish core.source="hand-core 1"
# pike (a broad highway designed for high-speed traffic): a kind of fish, by k.animals.animal
@k.objects.kinds.pike k.objects.stand_in name=pike drawing=fish core.source="hand-core 1"
# stork (large mostly Old World wading birds typically having white-and-black plumage): a kind of bird, by k.animals.animal
